{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d41e8e7dbc080b029b1fa461bd36a0b34b20ca9f781a5bc4d31af9554ed0d5cc", "ja": "伊織、お疲れさま。\n新しい衣装の具合はどうだ？", "zh": "伊织，辛苦了。\n新衣服穿着感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "be0dc531935211d35269a15d6f833e0a66178912e23e62e25f4bcac267d5092c", "ja": "とってもいい感じ！\n生地も縫製もしっかりしてるし、気に入ったわ♪", "zh": "感觉特别棒！\n面料和做工都很扎实，我很喜欢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e7eb7fdf38287f51b91650264a13ae3244861acc15ae168544022e08dbd6f9cd", "ja": "それはよかった。前から伊織には、そういう\nかっこいい系も似合うと思ってたんだ。", "zh": "那就好。我一直觉得，像这种帅气风格的衣服也很适合伊织。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "6a430bcdfeb5e8f96efa09af41879b51e9d461cc5b7bf01844eaf8d9bf02c31c", "ja": "あら、似合うに決まってるじゃない。スーパーアイドル\n伊織ちゃんに、似合わない服なんてないんだから♪", "zh": "哎呀，这还用说嘛。本超级偶像\n伊织，可没有穿不了的衣服♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "187bce001f1fd3446e552390a25d86baf88ec178049b73f8c6fd01c0261cef25", "ja": "それに、これって歌劇団のレヴュー風の衣装でしょ？\n華やかで美しくて、きらびやかで、凛々しくて！", "zh": "而且，这可是歌剧团风格的戏剧服装吧？\n华丽、美丽、璀璨，又英姿飒爽！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "462c7a35146d5a87b83bea14f9851c80000ed09a2f1743741f36549647f0132e", "ja": "まさに、私のためにあるようなテーマだもの！\nきっと似合わないように作る方が難しいわ♪", "zh": "这主题简直就像是为我量身打造的嘛！\n要故意做成不适合我的样子，反而比较难呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d6d21edee9f9cba145405330f93afc9b9b5098df0b7562a89f2664d674343309", "ja": "そ……そうだな！　それにしても、思ってた以上に\nばっちり似合ってて安心したよ。", "zh": "对……对啊！不过话说回来，比我想象中还要合适，真是让我放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "fa6220b109761d8a305b72d6500f3d7f2b91aeda073353dc1744d44b66136776", "ja": "でも……こんなに似合うのに、今回だけなんてもったい\nないわよね。劇場のレヴュー公演、増やさないの？", "zh": "可是……明明这么合适，却只有这一次，未免太可惜了吧。\n不增加几场剧场的歌舞剧公演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "495e59b71520fbc890651407d3094f96f7371e75111452a65552013957ab13c1", "ja": "私以外にも真とか、千鶴とか朋花とか……。\nううん、意外と全員できるんじゃない？", "zh": "除了我以外，还有真、千鹤、朋花她们……不，仔细想想，大家意外地都能胜任吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4cc388e473cd042db887d2e0d924a8dfdb5867edcff8e1d460aa4513979b81a9", "ja": "たしかに、公演のバリエーションとしても\n面白いよな。ちょっと予定を見直してみるか……。", "zh": "确实，作为演出的多样性来说也很有意思。要不要重新看看安排……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "e99045e603ef0a4dbf1fabd9e91dd24460694775c34e4644b60b4f3f9e02164a", "ja": "そうだ！　いっそのこと、私たちが本物の歌劇団の\n公演に出てあげるっていうのはどう？", "zh": "对了！干脆由我们去给真正的歌剧团演出，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "1ee1c71e6fa88aeb330af23fc8e64ed6eb432e41fc85840bc4db59136bdf2065", "ja": "うん、面白くなりそう！　まず私が出られるように、\nアンタに動いてもらおうかしら♪", "zh": "嗯，感觉会很有趣！为了让我能先登场，\n就派你先去打点一下吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1012_p", "source_sha256": "41942ef6fc17d52f25f6fd1e6e0359fe1e524159183cdbf35e008863fcf24b92", "ja": "本物の歌劇団の公演に？\nうーん、さすがに難しそうだけど……。", "zh": "要参加真正的歌剧团演出？\n嗯——这未免也太难了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1013_p", "source_sha256": "bdbc5ce7e6973be9b1fb8a8effb58bb3af04869e865e3c4accbdcfd23579a94b", "ja": "でも絶対話題にはなるだろうし……、\n案外いけるかな？", "zh": "不过肯定会成为话题……说不定意外地可行呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "c6b207b4c7bb37a73886c1ef795aada28726e836e5a29740b036208614a29bb0", "ja": "でしょ？　それじゃ、さっそくお願いね！\n簡単にあきらめちゃダメよ？", "zh": "对吧？那就赶紧拜托你了！\n可不能这么轻易就放弃哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4a1dc1c37e455fe7601436761488048e2bdbea49d9dba6009d8fe58cff9049b0", "ja": "わかってるよ。それに俺も、本格的な大舞台での\n伊織の活躍を、オペラグラスで見守ってみたいし。", "zh": "我知道啦。而且我也想用歌剧望远镜，看看伊织在真正的大舞台上大显身手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "33c90e60d3e3e0fe9ea899bafe2d76576adb0df61c2bfa1f3a34e144c2a19f89", "ja": "そうこなくっちゃ♪　この伊織ちゃんが、\nレヴュー界を席巻する日も近いわね！", "zh": "就该这样嘛♪ 我家伊织席卷戏剧界的日子也不远了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "b4a32b82a2113e5a9cc624a5629f10c142b012138b7fac69ddf95696d62ed876", "ja": "でも……いっとくけど、\nアンタにオペラグラスなんかいらないわよ？", "zh": "不过……我先说好，\n你可不需要什么歌剧望远镜哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e8e407b55de89da92dbb515bd69b2a9ae31b581cf400755d7361b7b39953ee45", "ja": "えっ？　でも、あったほうが顔も見えて……。", "zh": "诶？可是，有望远镜的话，不是也能看清脸吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "89716bb13b448c59cc95cc3f0e01afa39568f880474237d4ec83220551d75c64", "ja": "いいのっ！　アンタの席は……、\n舞台から一番近い席に決まってるじゃない。", "zh": "这样就行！你的座位……，\n当然得是离舞台最近的位置啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0144_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "11eedd6c2b0dbeaef9d55d99f4a7cdfb6444a4a9a7c5d7a7a6a2b468b8e290d8", "ja": "だって、私のプロデューサーなんだもの。遠くから\n眺めるだけなんて、許さないんだから。……にひひっ♪", "zh": "毕竟你可是我的制作人嘛。只是在远处\n看着什么的，我可不允许。……嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
